Marks this folder as the game's web root for Phaser Editor.

WHY IT EXISTS. Phaser Editor resolves the URLs inside an Asset Pack from the PROJECT
root by default. Our packs live here and their URLs read "assets/castle/courtyard.png",
because Vite serves this folder at "/" — so at runtime the browser resolves them
against public/, not against card-engine/ and not against the repo root.

Without this marker the Editor would look for "<project>/assets/castle/courtyard.png",
find nothing, and show every asset as broken while the game itself worked fine.

With it, the project folder can be opened anywhere above this point — the repo root is
fine, so you can see the docs and the app together — and the paths still resolve the
same way they do in the running game.

The file is deliberately empty apart from this note. Its presence is the signal.
